  <term:bibliographicCitation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Kim JT, Kim YH, Ghanem AM. Perforator chimerism for the reconstruction of complex defects: A new chimeric free flap classification system. J Plast Reconstr Aesthet Surg. 2015 Nov;68(11):1556-67. doi: 10.1016/j.bjps.2015.07.004. Epub 2015 Jul 29. PMID: 26323993.</term:bibliographicCitation>
